  "description": "Blazify is a modern, themeable, RTL-first Blazor UI component library for .NET 8 and .NET 10. It ships 50+ pure CSS/SVG components — data grid, inputs, date/time pickers, Jalali (Persian) calendar, dialogs, charts, navigation, forms and more — with first-class right-to-left support, Persian/Arabic/English localization, Tailwind-based theming and no heavy JS dependencies. Works with Blazor Server, WebAssembly and the unified Blazor Web App model.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
